sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as ALE instance
    participant A as Model adapter
    participant M as ONNX graph
    participant S as Argmax selector
    E->>A: uint8 frames [4,84,84]
    A->>A: float32, /255 once, add N
    A->>M: observation [N,4,84,84]
    M-->>S: q_values [N,4]
    S->>S: argmax over four values
    S-->>E: 0 NOOP / 1 FIRE / 2 RIGHT / 3 LEFT
    Note over E: ALE owns grayscale, resize, skip, and stack.
    Note over M: Graph excludes ALE and image preprocessing.
